Solargong Pneumatique

Ingredients: AFROBEAT + 432Hz RELAXING MEDITATIVE STYLES + Xylophone
Creative Catalyst: It began as protest music performed on hacked traffic infrastructure.

A hypnotic, ultra-physical collision where the kinetic polyrhythms of West African Afrobeat are violently decelerated and tuned to the mathematical calm of A=432Hz. Driven by modified pneumatic crosswalk buttons, hacked signal relays, and massive balafons fitted with resonating brass exhaust pipes, the music operates as a weaponized hypnotic state. Marrying liquid, warm sub-bass drops with the dry, woody percussive chatter of custom-tuned timber xylophones, the sound moves like a slow-motion stampede through an enchanted intersection. The brass horns do not blow fast, chaotic riffs; instead, they exhale endless, ambient sustain chords that act like a velvet fog over an unbreakable, swaying hip-shake groove.

Genre DNA
